  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "While walking, the party discovered a magnificent building rising through
    the mist.\\nThe doors were wide open, and inside, the air was filled with settled
    dust and the scent of old paper.\\n\\n\u201CA library of incredible size\u2026?\u201D
    Dorothy whispered in surprise.\\n\\nSophia\u2019s eyes gleamed as she noticed
    the arrangement of books and smelled the characteristic scent of magical tomes,\\nwhile
    Kyla found passages inscribed with scripture and brushed away the dust with her
    fingers.\\n\\nMeanwhile, Dorothy picked out a book on the shelf that caught her
    attention.\\nThe thick cover bore the marks of time, yet strange glowing letters
    were engraved on its surface.\\nCurious about its contents, Dorothy hesitated,
    then decided to choose who would hold the book."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d8556fd1a640a5c4188fdf04e64f706b, type: 2}
